From 5f80ea10a35c59bf7714e8fe33b0beb6b38f99ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Naresh <ghostwriternr@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 19:17:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] terminal: Add native launcher integration

Squash the final terminal-launcher implementation carried by the personal
Zed fork on top of upstream v1.12.0. The source history is preserved in:

- 9f491765e5 terminal: Define launcher protocol
- dbb45fbcbc terminal: Own launcher context per panel
- c078c47834 terminal: Propagate launcher context
- 2e806213ad terminal: Address launcher review findings
- e6d4c269e4 terminal: Silence launcher dead_code warnings
- 94872e45fb agent: Propagate launcher env to terminals
- de77221598 workspace: Signal panel initialization
- 49dea5f5c0 terminal: Define idempotent launcher methods
- 5f80ea10a3 terminal: Reuse launcher tabs by session

